## geoknife package tutorial  

Set the boundaries for the data to be downloaded.  

```{r}
stencil <- webgeom('state::Massachusetts')
```

Set the data source for downloading.  

```{r}
fabric <- webdata(list(times = as.POSIXct(c('1990-01-01','2005-12-31')),
                       url = 'https://cida.usgs.gov/thredds/dodsC/cmip5_bcsd/future_1.html',
                       variables = 
                       )
                  )
```


```{r}
job <- geoknife(stencil, fabric, wait = TRUE)
```

